      "writtenOn": "2017-02-14T18:50:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is still good to confirm what the behavior is.  I think it is worth asking to make sure we understand what is going on for a first connection vs roaming.  If they are the same, great, if they are different, we need to understand that.",
