      "writtenOn": "2017-02-14T22:28:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This can always be checked by looking at the logs. WifiNetworkSelector still tells which BSSId the framework picks and WifiStateMachine\u0026Supplicant logs tell us which BSSID the firmware actually connects to. This is the same as the case of roaming.",
